OL,3,GNEWSASouthport families 'blown away' by
OL,4,Asupport for memorial garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouthport MP Patrick Hurley said there
OL,7,Fhad been "overwhelming support" for the
OL,8,Fproject, despite some objections.
